<title>JAPAN: Foreigners net buyers of Japanese stocks in week.</title>
<headline>Foreigners net buyers of Japanese stocks in week.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners were net buyers of Japanese stocks on the Tokyo, Osaka and Nagoya stock exchanges in the week of May 6 to May 9, exchange data showed.</p>
<p>Foreigners were net buyers for the third consecutive week.</p>
<p>The figures, which are rounded, are as follows:</p>
<p>    Total foreign buying	   817.15 billion yen</p>
<p>    Total foreign selling	  519.05 billion yen</p>
<p>    Net buying			 298.10 billion yen</p>
<p>    Previous week net buying     175.34 billion yen</p>
